Show one source module or the generated runtime files

Usage: xrm config show [OPTIONS] PROFILE [MODULE]

POSITIONALS:
  PROFILE (required)      Exact Profile name or UUID (saved configuration) 
  MODULE                  Native Xray module key, for example dns or routing 

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 
        --module-key MODULE 
                          Native Xray module key, for example dns or routing 
        --source SOURCE   Choices: source, runtime. Default: source. 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm config show Home dns
  xrm config show Home --source runtime

Profile accepts an exact saved name or UUID.
